## INTEGRATION WITH ZEYA888 METHODOLOGY

**Compatible methodologies** (work as-is):
- ✅ Vibe Coding / CR-loop (6 phases)
- ✅ ListX → ItemY decomposition
- ✅ Quality Gates concept (understand checkpoints)
- ✅ MCP tracking (evidence-based scoring)
- ✅ @analysis.mdc principles (no assumptions, verify)

**Requires manual involvement**:
- ⚠️ Auto-triggers → You remind user
- ⚠️ Cross-file loading → User provides files OR Projects
- ⚠️ Modular rules → User aware of appendix need

