## QUICK REFERENCE TABLE

| Syntax Element | Format | Claude Action | Fallback |
|----------------|--------|---------------|----------|
| **Front matter** | `---\nYAML\n---` | Extract description, ignore globs | Work without metadata |
| **Cross-ref** | `@rule#section` | Find in context, use content | Ask user OR work without |
| **Anchor** | `## #anchor` | Mark as section target | N/A (passive marker) |
| **Auto-trigger** | `AUTO-TRIGGERS @rule` | Remind user at checkpoint | Skip if user declines |
| **Modular (.core)** | `.core.mdc` filename | Scan appendix refs, inform user | Work with core only |

